// Library.Synth.ailang
// Instanceable oscillator bank. Wave generation first; samples later
// plug in as another voice source on the same envelope / mix.
//
// Internal: 32-bit phase accumulator, s16 oscillator, then bit crush.
// Output character is a quantizer (4/8/16/24/32), not a second engine.
// NES: 4-bit / pulse / LFSR. VST path: 16–32 bit + linear interp.
//
// Instance = handle. One per MIDI channel, or one shared pool.
// Threads later: workers render voice slices into the mix buffer
// (ThreadTrampoline user_data = synth + range). Do not spawn until
// single-thread render is correct.
//
// Copyright 2026 Sean Collins, 2 Paws Machine and Engineering. SCSL.

LibraryImport.Media.Sample
LibraryImport.Media.SF2

